   "say": "Look at this example. RSI crosses seventy here. Selling would have meant fighting the trend: RSI stayed above seventy on thirty-five of the next thirty-seven bars, and price rose another thirteen percent."
  },
  {
   "type": "rows",
   "title": "Read RSI in context",
   "head": [
    "",
    "",
    ""
