     "hi": 111.43,
     "color": "coral",
     "label": "Crossed 6 times",
     "at": 0.55
    }
   ],
   "say": "But every moving average lags. When the market goes sideways, the line goes flat, and price crosses it again and again. In this example it crossed six times in twenty-seven bars."
  },
